								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description10.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/059-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />3-10<span class="txtlinks">Assassination of Prime Minister HARA</span></a></h5>
