								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description13.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/063-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />3-13<span class="txtlinks">Adoption of Universal Manhood Suffrage Law and Peace Preservation Law</span></a></h5>
								<ul>
									<li>Draft of the three Factions' Committee's Decision on Universal Manhood Suffrage</li>
