								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="colThumb">
								<h5><a href="description14.html"><img src="/modern/thumb/g_thumb/064-001g.jpg" alt="" width="74" height="74" />3-14<span class="txtlinks">First Regular Election with Universal Manhood Suffrage</span></a></h5>
								<ul>
									<li>Gist of Speech Delivered at Rikken Minseito's Kansai Convention</li>
